nicalEntityId":"vndb:s5507","name":"桐生たつひこ(桐生タツヒコ)","detail":"企画・ディレクター、CG監修、CG彩色、システムグラフィック","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:195887","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"うつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s12562","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:21817","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12562","name":"うつみ","detail":"企画・ディレクター、プロット、スクリプト","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:195888","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"深山裕子制作研究所","creatorId":"egs:creator:32218","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:32218","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:32218","name":"深山裕子制作研究所","detail":"背景","roleCode":"other","roleLabel":"其他","identityStatus":"no-alias-hit","relationId":"egs:work-creator:195930","source":"egs"},{"creditedName":"M&M","creatorId":"vndb:s2724","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2724","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2724","name":"M&M","roleCode":"chardesign","roleLabel":"角色设计","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:145265","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"桐生 タツヒコ","creatorId":"vndb:s5507","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5507","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5507","name":"桐生 たつひこ","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:145270","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"うつみ","creatorId":"vndb:s12562","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12562","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12562","name":"うつみ","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:145271","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c61124","characterName":"神門 百合","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55295","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213322"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16552"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61124"},"originalCharacterName":"神門 百合","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The middle daughter of the Mikado clan, she is given permission from her university to return home for the duration of the rite. Haughty and arrogant, she will only acknowledge individuals of worth with all others either beneath her concern or ruthlessly exploited as tools."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"The closest in personality of the Mikado females to her grandfather (biological father) Heizo, she yearns for the freedom to marry the spouse of her choice and is willing to plot the downfall of candidates participating in the rite who are obstacles to her desires."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She freely admits she is starved of affection as her father Kouji died before she could spend meaningful time with him. After his death her mother grew cold and distant and her grandfather encouraged her inflated sense of self-worth whilst eyeing her up as his next child-bearing candidate."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61124"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神門家の次女"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高慢でプライドが高い。市内の名門女子高に屋敷から通学しているが現在、重要な儀式の期間という事で学園を休み屋敷に滞在している。徹底した能力主義者であり、能力に劣るとみなした者は"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"見下し人間扱いしない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16552","sourceWorkId":"25229","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神門家の次女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"高慢でプライドが高い。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55295"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c0/c05222c07d4c27012decfebd2ca77ce0e9f715a8e0bef5f93e31276d6a1ac49e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1a/1a45e8c7b6eb422596f1e5ea31cf4f6117a8a3e26fcec4fa5931b3a234ff1bce.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岬 友美","creatorId":"vndb:s128","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s128","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s128","name":"星野 千寿子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76304","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61127","characterName":"帯刀 怜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55298","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213322"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16555"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61127"},"originalCharacterName":"帯刀 怜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The secretary to the Mikado clan, Rei is also responsible for Ririka's home schooling and the management of the household servants. She is absolutely loyal to the Mikado household and will execute any command given by the clan heads without question."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Originally an orphan from beyond Japanese shores, she was bought by Heizo when he chanced upon her on a business trip and brought to Japan as his possession. Her name is the one she adopts after being bought by Heizo. She is also well-versed in medicine and is responsible for concocting the unguents ingested by Heizo and Fumika as well as improving their efficacy through use of freshly procured body parts from kidnapped children. Her loyalty is to Heizo alone despite her pact with Maruyama during the rite; she obeys Fumika's instructions and serves her faithfully as a secretary but is well aware Fumika is little more than a puppet under Heizo's domination."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She derives pleasure when treated as an object rather than a human and cannot be sexually aroused unless she is denigrated and abused by sexual partners. Rei is quite happy to engage in orgies with the male household staff after berating them in the daytime as a way to \"release stress\". Her sole hobby is collecting more knowledge to create more potent aphrodisiacs and unguents, which is her main motive for working in concert with Maruyama without Heizo's knowledge (although she has no intention of betraying Heizo)."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61127"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神門家の秘書"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"史華、兵蔵に忠誠を誓い、二人の言葉であればどのような命令であっても従う。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16555","sourceWorkId":"25229","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神門家の執事。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"史華の腹心。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55298"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bf1a744a2ff089bacee4841d90885d2419d08c5320f1c33a0d1d49533ac5ac2d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21bc8f99be033036a6912833c53293c2f0db487c507ed925d69b71ec5634ac44.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ヒマリ","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76306","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c61128","characterName":"曽我部 織江","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55299","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"213322"}],"egsCharacterIds":["16556"],"vndbCharacterId":"c61128"},"originalCharacterName":"曽我部 織江","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Polite and approachable, the Mikado household's sole maid is also responsible for the household meals. Her cooking repertoire is quite diverse with dishes including frog's legs and tortoise shell stew in addition to more conventional meals. She frequently uses the kitchen late at night to experiment with new dishes until they are of an acceptable standard to serve the Mikado masters."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Orie's parents were servants at the Mikado household and together with her younger brother she assisted with the household chores until she was old enough to assume more important responsibilities on her own. She has never been to school but is very skilled at her tasks because of the spartan training endured under Heizo."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Yuri frequently abuses Orie through physical beatings and coercion to sexual acts with other household staff. Orie hates Yuri and the other abusive Mikado members enough to kill them, but her conditioning was complete enough to compel her to suffer in silence."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Orie will go to great lengths to help Ririka escape the mansion after the rite. Ririka saved Orie from a certain death at Heizo's hands which led to Orie being charged with caring for Ririka's daily needs. They became friends despite their master-servant relationship and share hobbies such as reading girls' magazines. After learning about most of the secrets of the Mikado household and the visit of Yoshito's professor prior to the start of the rite, she feels she has to entrust Yoshito with Ririka's fate as he is the only person she trusts amongst the participants."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Despite appearances, Orie is actually older than Yoshito and can easily pass for a high-school student should she choose to do so."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c61128"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"館の使用人"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"朗らかで親しみやすい性格。神門家の食事は全て彼女が担っており料理番としての仕事も受け持つ"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"16556","sourceWorkId":"25229","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"館の使用人。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55299"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/27/2733df5db8ab7129c9aee56ddda9ab8e101edbc456a40a60e53aa3649f07c22c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b11f4032e219d833c3bd306a986ef737ccc4101a4ffa9df0e96c109ba89e74f3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"手塚 りょうこ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:76308","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c62999","characterName":"曽我部 健","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c62999"},"originalCharacterName":"曽我部 健","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Mikado household butler. Follows the orders of the head of household without question."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His loyalty is to the effective clan head (usually Heizou and at times Kazuo). Usually tasked with physically subduing intruders or mansion guests who have learned too many secrets."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Usually posted in front of Heizou's private quarters when he's busy with women to ward off potential intruders and ensure the secret passageways are not accessed to spy on Heizou's actions."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Loyalty to household overrides loyalty to family and he has no qualms using full force against women."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c62999"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/eb/ebebb23afe4785c6011ac6926e0c44815687d180766f2648f46a8464d42e4a92.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fb/fb7a1f1012af668219e94c8129154bbed14aa7a0664d8e6682577a792bcb94dc.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c63000","characterName":"田所 烈次郎","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c63000"},"originalCharacterName":"田所 烈次郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The gardener of the Mikado estate. One of the oldest and most senior of the household staff who voluntarily lives in a cottage on the mansion grounds. Trusted by Heizou for his work dedication and efficiency."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He maintains a perverse collection of hair and nails from the female inhabitants of the mansion, even going as far as to collect samples inside the mansion on occasion."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"A magician who taught Heizou the rituals to commune with the Gods through the Miko, he is obsessed with the creation of a God of his own using the stillborn foetus of Ririka's younger brother and feeding the mass of meat with the hair and nails he collects."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Most of the Mikado family and the household staff abhor his presence with the sole exception of Mikado Aya. He is happy to repay the years of kind treatment she bestowed on him through mass murder of all mansion inhabitants using a pair of gardening shears, even burning the mansion down after placing the corpses in a huge pile underground to avoid forensic investigation."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63000"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bf/bfbc60ad349d6304ec459c157aa2fdda606630bfce35702b76c98ef8eb831674.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2e/2e63615cfaa64694478a73fa24dedde51ee22b443b047d0421b1ffd57621b0ae.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65848","characterName":"河原崎 さちこ",